## What changed and why\
\
The `walnut/amber/wheat` palette was retired. It was hard on the eyes for daily use, especially on iPhone (60% of Chad's usage). Replaced with **"Garden Party"** \'97 a nature-inspired, editorial, pastel-friendly system with full light/dark support.\
\
The design was chosen from a 4-direction exploration (Sage Garden, Stone & Moss, Meadow, Conservatory) plus 2 remixes (Sage Meadow, Garden Party). Garden Party won \'97 it pairs Meadow's playful rounded cards and dot-filter chips with Sage Garden's Instrument Serif typography and a botanical leaf watermark on each card.\
