## Garden Party design system (source of truth)\
\
### Light mode tokens\
```\
--bg:        #F6F2E8    /* warm paper */\
--bg-2:      #EFEADA\
--paper:     #FDFAF2    /* card background */\
--ink:       #1E2A20\
--ink-2:     #4A5448\
--ink-3:     #7E887C    /* muted */\
--line:      #D9D2BF\
--line-2:    #C6BEA6\
--sage:      #6E8B6A\
--sage-deep: #35523A    /* primary accent */\
--sage-soft: #B4C9B0\
--sage-tint: rgba(110,139,106,0.14)\
\
/* Secondary pastels \'97 used sparingly for badges only */\
--sky-tint:    #DBE5EC   --sky-deep:    #3A5468\
--lilac-tint:  #E7DCE7   --lilac-deep:  #4F3A65\
--blush-tint:  #EBD2CF   --blush-deep:  #6E3A36\
--butter-tint: #E2E8D0   --butter-deep: #5B6B2E\
```\
\
### Dark mode tokens (activated by `[data-theme="dark"]` on `<html>`)\
```\
--bg:        #0F1511    /* deep forest night \'97 NOT brown */\
--bg-2:      #151D17\
--paper:     #18211B\
--ink:       #E8EEE2\
--ink-2:     #B4BEB0\
--ink-3:     #7C867A\
--line:      #25302A\
--sage:      #8CAF87\
--sage-deep: #B4D3AE    /* lifted for contrast on dark bg */\
--sage-soft: #4D6B4F\
```\
\
### Typography\
- **Instrument Serif** \'97 headers, wordmarks, card project titles, priority strong text\
- **Geist** \'97 all UI / body text\
- **Geist Mono** \'97 numbered-priority badges, section labels, counts, tag-like meta\
\
All three are Google Fonts. Single import line:\
```html\
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />\
```\
\
### Signature elements\
- **Wordmark pattern**: serif name with italic period in sage-deep, e.g. `Garden<em>.</em>` or `Project Name<em>.</em>`\
- **Card numbered badges**: 20px circle, `--sage-tint` bg, `--sage-deep` mono numeral\
- **Backlog lines**: dash prefix (hairline `::before` in sage), not bullets\
- **Leaf watermark**: 96px botanical SVG, absolute-positioned bottom-right of cards, `opacity: 0.14` (light) / `0.18` (dark), fades up to `0.24` on hover. Template in `index.html` under `<template id="leaf-template">`.\
- **Badges (staleness)**: pastel-tinted pills, `::before` dot in `currentColor`. Tiers: `fresh` (sage) / `recent` (butter) / `due` (lilac) / `stale` (blush).\
- **Chips (filters)**: rounded pill, inactive = paper bg + line border, active = `--sage-deep` bg + paper text. Monospace count badge inline.\
- **Mode toggle**: pill with sun + moon icons, active one = `--ink` bg + `--bg` fg.\
- **Card radius**: 16\'9620px. **Grid gap**: 14px mobile, 18px desktop.\
\
### Persistence keys (localStorage)\
- `gp.theme` \'97 `"light"` | `"dark"` (falls back to system preference on first visit)\
- `gp.filter` \'97 `"all"` | `"fresh"` | `"stale"`\
