## Dashboard behaviors (index.html)\
\
- **Fetch**: `Promise.allSettled` over `projects.json`. Pulsing skeleton cards during load.\
- **Staleness tiers** (driven by `updated` date in each tracker's `#tracker-data`):\
  - `fresh` \'97 `<7 days`\
  - `recent` \'97 `7\'9613 days` (update due)\
  - `due` \'97 `14\'9627 days`\
  - `stale` \'97 `28+ days`\
- **Filter chips**: `fresh` filter shows `<7 days`, `stale` filter shows `14+ days`. Counts update after fetch.\
- **Refresh button**: re-runs `init()` (spin animation while pending).\
- **Errors**: per-project error card with blush-tinted mono error body, no global failure.\
- **Theme**: first visit respects `prefers-color-scheme`; user's toggle choice wins thereafter.\
